  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Đặt <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, khi đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tVì <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Do đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tVì <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math> nên\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/0dd1c4864a2246d01b839729bb7b3fc8a225b89196f9c63282ea7c00fe54780c.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>\n\t\t\n\t\tDo đó chiều dài <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>L</mi></semantics></math> là\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tXét hàm số <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có\n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tBảng biến thiên\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/8537b3cae6e574ae7a95a982d8e0e13d05c6073fcef2896838b92deb06fb3d5a.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tSuy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>min</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>243</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> khi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.",
